## Testing Checklist

When implementing token refresh:
- [ ] Tokens persist after page refresh
- [ ] User stays logged in when refreshing page
- [ ] Logout clears all tokens
- [ ] Invalid refresh token logs user out
- [ ] Token refresh works in both dev and production
- [ ] Multiple tabs stay in sync (one logs out → others log out)
- [ ] Works with slow network (token refresh in progress when closing tab)

