## Environment Configuration

Make sure your `.env` files have the correct API base URL:

```bash
# Development (for local testing, optional due to proxy)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Production (Lambda Function URL)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-lambda-function-url.lambda-url.region.on.aws
```

Without this in production, token refresh will fail.
